# Overpass Shoal (CIPlay overpass_shoal): the ramp top, the toll booth log, the sunken lane's air pocket, the van's
# glovebox (the booth key), the booth's strongbox (refused without the key is not tested here: the key comes first),
# the bus locker.
island Overpass Shoal
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Drowned Highway
zone ramp_top
expect step 1
read Toll booth log
expect step 2
zone op_summit
wait 2
expect step 3
open Toll hill locker
wait 3
expect step 4
read Teo's card (Toll Hill)
expect step 5
zone sunken_lane
air sunken_lane
expect step 6
open Van glovebox
wait 3
expect story boothkey 1
expect step 7
open Toll booth strongbox
wait 3
expect step 8
read Toll keeper's tally
expect step 9
read Caravan diary
expect step 10
open Bus locker
wait 3
expect step 11
open Glovebox (yellow caravan)
wait 3
open Glovebox (green caravan)
wait 3
open Glovebox (far caravan)
wait 3
open Glovebox (blue caravan)
wait 3
open Glovebox (beach trailer)
wait 3
use opbench
expect story op_jack 1
expect step 12
use opcap
expect story op_lifted 1
expect step 13
air op_dair
open Depot chest
wait 3
expect step 14
read Depot foreman's note
expect done
